N:design-taste-frontend
D:Apply anti-generic frontend design rules bundled from Leonxlnx/taste-skill for landing pages, portfolios, editorial pages, and redesigns. Declare a design read, set DESIGN_VARIANCE MOTION_INTENSITY and VISUAL_DENSITY explicitly, pick a real design system or name the aesthetic, sweep AI tells including the em-dash ban, audit before redesigning, and pass the pre-flight check. Not for dashboards, data tables, wizards, or admin UI.
G:design-taste-frontend taste-skill anti-slop frontend-design landing-page portfolio redesign ai-tells em-dash-ban design-variance motion-intensity visual-density awwwards linear-style

U[5]:
  Fix a landing page portfolio or marketing site that looks templated or AI-default
  Modernize a redesign without discarding logo brand color naming or legal copy
  Execute a named aesthetic such as Linear-clean brutalist or premium consumer
  Sweep AI tells and run the pre-flight check before shipping a page
  Decide whether the brief is in scope at all before generating anything

S[7]{n,step,details}:
  1,Scope check,dashboards data tables wizards code editors native mobile and realtime collab are disclaimed; name the right tool instead
  2,Use bundled rules,the operative ruleset ships in this skill's references under MIT attribution; no install and no network needed
  3,Declare the design read,one line naming page kind audience vibe and design system; ask at most one question when it genuinely diverges
  4,Set dials explicitly,DESIGN_VARIANCE MOTION_INTENSITY VISUAL_DENSITY with baseline 8/6/4; silent baseline is a pre-flight failure
  5,Choose honestly,pick an official design system when the brief implies one or name the aesthetic family; never ship an unnamed default
  6,Sweep AI tells,zero em-dashes anywhere visible plus gradient hero equal-card grids Inter slate-900 and placeholder content
  7,Pre-flight then report,theme color and shape locks WCAG AA CTA and form contrast hero fit and reduced motion; state which boxes passed

R[10]:
  Bundled from Leonxlnx/taste-skill commit ccbc15639c97057cbfcf32ecebc38ef716e4bb37 dated 2026-08-24 MIT copyright leonxlnx
  Upstream folder is skills/taste-skill but its frontmatter name is design-taste-frontend
  That shared name means installing upstream can shadow or overwrite this catalog copy so it is not a setup step
  This skill is self-contained; references carry the operative rules and LICENSE.upstream.txt carries the MIT notice
  Em-dash ban is binary; a single visible em-dash or separator en-dash fails pre-flight
  Quiet constraints such as public-sector or accessibility-critical override aesthetic preference
  Redesign preserve mode never silently changes logo brand color product naming or legal copy
  Contrast and reduced motion are ship gates not polish
  Dashboards and dense product UI route to design-system with Fluent Carbon Atlassian or Polaris
  Deeper accessibility remediation routes to web-accessibility and layout adaptation to responsive-design

E[4]{type,command}:
  Install skill,npx skills add https://github.com/akillness/jeo-skills --skill design-taste-frontend
  Check provenance,curl -fsS https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill/ccbc15639c97057cbfcf32ecebc38ef716e4bb37/skills/taste-skill/SKILL.md | head -40
  Validate evals,node .agent-skills/design-taste-frontend/scripts/validate-evals.mjs --json
  Validate skill,bash .agent-skills/skill-standardization/scripts/validate_skill.sh .agent-skills/design-taste-frontend
